  "story": {
    "day": 52,
    "title": "Kaya's Special Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya put on her T-shirt and went to her parent's restaurant.",
      "Her dear father was the boss; Kaya often watched him.",
      "She wanted to work as a chef there someday.",
      "He taught her to roll rice on seaweed.",
      "Inside, she put cucumber and avocado.",
      "\"This healthy roll is famous!\" her father said.",
      "He also prepared delicious crab meat.",
      "Many people know our special dishes.",
      "A reporter came to interview him.",
      "Kaya looked up; it was interesting news from the U.S.",
      "The restaurant, with its unique style, served us those rolls.",
      "Kaya felt like a true hero that day."
    ]
  }
}